  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, the position of circumcentre<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be origin,&nbsp;position vector of orthocentre<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and position vectors of <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi></math> are <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> respectively<br />Centroid of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0025_e6173ec7a181.png\" style=\"width:1.92014in;height:0.93333in\" /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> (given)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>12</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0025_d4947c98a7b1.jpeg\" style=\"width: 170px; height: 174px;\" /></p><p>From diagram,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math></p>"
